<title>USA: Consolidated Products sets 10 pct stock div.</title>
<headline>Consolidated Products sets 10 pct stock div.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS, Ind. 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consolidated Products Inc said its board voted a 10 percent stock dividend payable January 20, 1997, record January 6, 1997.</p>
<p>The restaurant company previously reported that revenues and net earnings for the fiscal year ended September 25, 1996 were at record levels.</p>
<p>		  ((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
